1
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:17,560
[Fifty years ago]

2
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,010
[Spirit Tablet
of the Late Madam Zhang, Wife of Li]

3
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,780
[Li Shan]

4
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,600
I hired you to read
our Four Pillars of Destiny.

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,800
You said my wife and I
would be together for a long time,

6
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,290
[Teenage Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

7
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,110
[Former Sect Master Shen Yunhe]

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,800
and that it was a match made in heaven.

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,520
Yet not even a year later...

10
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,380
You still claim you're not a fraud?

11
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,960
I paid you so much money.

12
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,710
You must pay me back double

13
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:41,960
and kneel
before my late wife's spirit tablet

14
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,110
for 3 days.

15
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:43,820
Kneel!

16
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,750
Kneel before Madam!

17
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:45,600
Kneel!

18
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,820
Men!

19
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,750
Pull out their tongues!

20
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,720
Let's see if they dare to
scam anyone again!

21
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,490
Do it!

22
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:00,150
Honey.

23
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,600
Honey!

24
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,960
Honey!

25
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,880
When I read the Four Pillars of Destiny
of you and your wife back then,

26
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,490
I did say that

27
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,190
once you were married,

28
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:12,510
your family would prosper.

29
00:01:16,070 --> 00:01:17,000
But I...

30
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:20,210
never said both of you

31
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,950
had to be alive.

32
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:28,620
You and your wife are a rare case
of Yin and Yang clashing

33
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,620
yet generating each other,

34
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,270
with a hidden heavenly secret.

35
00:01:32,270 --> 00:01:34,470
When she was alive, it was a doomed bond,

36
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:36,009
but now that she's dead,

37
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,870
it has become

38
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,630
a good match.

39
00:01:45,789 --> 00:01:47,150
She's already dead.

40
00:01:47,509 --> 00:01:49,240
How can it still be a good match?

41
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,810
Your wife's fate blueprint
is an unusual one.

42
00:01:52,830 --> 00:01:56,190
As long as you keep her soul trapped
in your household,

43
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:58,910
it will turn into a twin lotus

44
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:02,240
and send your family soaring.

45
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:03,910
Your descendants

46
00:02:05,630 --> 00:02:07,480
will enjoy endless

47
00:02:08,110 --> 00:02:10,120
wealth and glory.

48
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,030
Mentor,

49
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:24,690
we made it through this crisis
just like that?

50
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,430
Pull out their tongues!

51
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,829
Let's see if they dare to
scam anyone again!

52
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:39,270
In our Tianxiang Sect,

53
00:02:39,290 --> 00:02:42,520
there is a scam
called the "double-sided scam,"

54
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:46,550
which involves a surface scheme
and a hidden one.

55
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:48,540
A scam has two sides,

56
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,820
and so do people.

57
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,140
You must remember,

58
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:54,420
what people believe

59
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:56,790
isn't a matter of truth or falsehood,

60
00:02:57,230 --> 00:03:00,190
but of which way
the scale in their own hearts

61
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:02,140
tips.

62
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:05,910
This scam will run for decades,

63
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:09,180
and one day it will become

64
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:11,140
your scam.

65
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:56,100
[A Prophet]

66
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:59,110
[Episode 20]

67
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:07,980
Jiang Feiyan saved Li Ling,

68
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:09,920
and Master Zhang found out.

69
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:11,140
Feiyan blew the scam.

70
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:13,940
She and the Second Batou must be
locked up at the Zhang residence by now.

71
00:05:13,940 --> 00:05:16,240
And now the Zhang family
has called in the Salt Gang.

72
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,790
The Salt Gang is not to be trifled with.

73
00:05:17,790 --> 00:05:19,620
Even I show them some respect.

74
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:21,950
If we can't make up for the missing girl,

75
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:24,810
how do you think
the Salt Gang will deal with Feiyan?

76
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:26,500
After thinking it over for a long time,

77
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,900
I believe there's only one way now.

78
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:30,980
You find that girl and kill her,

79
00:05:31,910 --> 00:05:33,980
and then the matter will be settled.

80
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:35,870
Between Li Ling and Feiyan,

81
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:38,190
you can only save one.

82
00:05:40,550 --> 00:05:41,880
Think it over yourself.

83
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:48,750
Let's go?

84
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:54,670
What are you doing?

85
00:05:54,670 --> 00:05:57,260
Zhang Yinhua discovered that
she'd escaped and detained Jiang Feiyan.

86
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,380
You have to come back with me to save her.

87
00:05:58,380 --> 00:05:59,900
She can't go back with you!

88
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:01,580
If she doesn't go back,
Jiang Feiyan will die!

89
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:03,260
If she goes, she will die!

90
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,750
Jiang Feiyan saved her life!

91
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:06,220
Li Ling must come with me.

92
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:06,820
No!

93
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,780
She can't go with you!

94
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:08,340
Let go!

95
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,110
Let go of her!

96
00:06:09,110 --> 00:06:10,190
She can't go with you!

97
00:06:10,190 --> 00:06:11,510
My friend won't hurt you!

98
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:12,440
She's not going!

99
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:13,750
Aunt.

100
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,950
I'll go with you.

101
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:20,950
Li Ling!

102
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,700
Aunt,

103
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:24,030
Miss Jiang got into trouble because of me.

104
00:06:24,110 --> 00:06:25,630
I can't just leave her to die.

105
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,510
But...

106
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,020
Let's go.

107
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:31,900
I'll go with you!

108
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:33,360
If we die, we die together!

109
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:37,110
Ma'am,

110
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,510
I'm also trying to figure out a way.

111
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:40,110
So don't make things harder.

112
00:06:40,990 --> 00:06:43,320
You've seen the Sect Master, haven't you?

113
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:45,020
You're caving just like that?

114
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:46,220
Are you really going to listen to him?

115
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:48,310
Are you really going to
send my niece to her death like this?

116
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,380
Aunt,

117
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:50,670
saving her is dangerous,

118
00:06:50,670 --> 00:06:51,670
but that doesn't mean I'll die.

119
00:06:51,670 --> 00:06:52,700
Stay out of it.

120
00:06:52,700 --> 00:06:53,870
Let me tell you,

121
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:56,950
you don't have
half the courage your mother had.

122
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:58,780
When your mother saved me back then,

123
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:02,260
she fought the Sect Master
with her life on the line.

124
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:05,070
You know my mother?

125
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:06,460
Over 20 years ago,

126
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:09,750
the Zhang family wanted to
kill me and trap my soul too.

127
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:11,800
It was your mother who saved me.

128
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:16,460
She even wrote to me 3 months ago.

129
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:18,260
Are you mistaken?

130
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:19,630
Eight years ago,
his mother, Shangguan Hong was...

131
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:20,580
Liang.

132
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:24,980
What did my mother say to you?

133
00:07:25,110 --> 00:07:27,380
She said she'd come to Yucheng
to visit me in a few days.

134
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:28,780
At that time, I was so worried

135
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:30,670
about my niece's marriage
to the Zhang family's son

136
00:07:30,670 --> 00:07:33,020
that I couldn't sleep for days.

137
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:34,870
So I asked your mother
to help me think of a way.

138
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:35,870
Your mother told me

139
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:38,510
to go directly to Yunhe Temple
and ask for you.

140
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:40,370
May you have infinite blessings.

141
00:07:40,550 --> 00:07:41,310
Then why didn't you

142
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,780
just tell me directly at that time?

143
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:44,580
Your mother told me you're warm-hearted

144
00:07:44,580 --> 00:07:45,630
and would definitely help me.

145
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:46,870
Besides,

146
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:48,950
didn't you fall out with your mother

147
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,580
over joining the Tianxiang Sect?

148
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:52,510
She said that if I mentioned her,

149
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:54,510
you definitely wouldn't come.

150
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,190
Such a serious matter—

151
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:56,430
why didn't you tell me?

152
00:07:56,430 --> 00:07:57,890
What was I supposed to say?

153
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:59,190
That Zhang boy was all you

154
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:00,750
could see and think about.

155
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:03,080
Would telling you have changed anything?

156
00:08:05,110 --> 00:08:07,510
That letter was written
by the Sect Master.

157
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:10,510
My mother died 8 years ago.

158
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:13,870
But the Sect Master
went to such great lengths

159
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:15,460
to involve you in this scam...

160
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,920
What exactly does he want?

161
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,900
He has something to say to me.

162
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:22,190
Ma'am, tell me

163
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:24,050
what exactly happened back then.

164
00:08:24,110 --> 00:08:25,260
Back then,

165
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:26,750
your mother told me everything

166
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:29,110
about the soul-trapping.

167
00:08:29,670 --> 00:08:31,140
To explain all this,

168
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:34,309
we have to start with my brother's death.

169
00:08:38,059 --> 00:08:40,309
[Thirty years ago]

170
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,960
[Young Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

171
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:50,320
[Shangguan Hong]

172
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:40,020
This is not good.

173
00:09:41,390 --> 00:09:42,220
Master,

174
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,030
what do you mean?

175
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:46,210
After the soul-trapping ritual
was performed,

176
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:48,210
your son's career soared,

177
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:49,490
and he rose to a high office.

178
00:09:49,490 --> 00:09:50,810
But as the saying goes,

179
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:53,470
"It's bitterly cold at the top."

180
00:09:54,070 --> 00:09:55,790
Master, you mean

181
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,620
my son is in danger?

182
00:09:57,670 --> 00:10:00,740
Your son now holds a high position
and is respected by all,

183
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,460
but danger lurks everywhere.

184
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:04,910
Although I've replaced
the soul-suppressing nail for you,

185
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:06,340
Madam Zhang's help

186
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,860
has been weakening.

187
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:09,430
I'm afraid she can no longer help sustain

188
00:10:09,430 --> 00:10:10,700
your family's fortune.

189
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:12,620
You must find a new subject
for another soul-trapping ritual

190
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:14,950
as soon as possible.

191
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:28,220
Master Li,

192
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:30,340
the higher the position,

193
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:32,820
the deeper the nail must be driven.

194
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:42,150
You fraud!

195
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:44,420
I've never forgotten
what you did to my mother.

196
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,490
[Li Yingfu]

197
00:10:44,550 --> 00:10:46,390
And you still dare to show your faces?

198
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:47,430
Yingfu,

199
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:48,910
absolutely not!

200
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,430
Without Master's protection,

201
00:10:50,430 --> 00:10:51,950
how could you have the wealth and status
you enjoy today?

202
00:10:51,950 --> 00:10:52,860
Father,

203
00:10:52,950 --> 00:10:54,210
I got to where I am today

204
00:10:54,390 --> 00:10:56,030
by putting my life on the line

205
00:10:56,150 --> 00:10:57,430
and fighting for it myself!

206
00:10:57,430 --> 00:10:58,150
Yingfu,

207
00:10:58,150 --> 00:10:59,670
calm down.

208
00:11:00,270 --> 00:11:01,030
Master,

209
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,100
my son is still young.

210
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:04,820
Please don't take offense.

211
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:05,860
It's fine.

212
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:08,670
Your son is just consumed
by a surge of evil fire.

213
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:09,310
Just find

214
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:11,740
a Xuanwu statue
blessed at a pure water ritual altar,

215
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,030
and it will protect his fortune.

216
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:14,150
Fooling the people

217
00:11:14,150 --> 00:11:16,210
with your sham supernatural tricks!

218
00:11:17,820 --> 00:11:18,550
Yingfu!

219
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:23,910
You unfilial son,

220
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,580
everyone believes it

221
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:26,460
except you.

222
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:27,310
If you keep this up,

223
00:11:27,310 --> 00:11:28,910
you'll be the ruin of the whole Li family!

224
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:30,580
You'll be the one to blame!

225
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:31,860
Don't go!

226
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:37,670
You fraud!

227
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:45,420
How dare you touch me?

228
00:11:46,430 --> 00:11:47,030
That slap of yours

229
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:49,160
has cost you some of your own lifespan.

230
00:11:50,780 --> 00:11:53,030
And your family will also suffer
a great disaster because of this.

231
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,390
Three days from now,
at a quarter to six in the evening,

232
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:58,460
7 leaves will fall from the old osmanthus tree
in the southeast corner of your house.

233
00:11:58,460 --> 00:11:59,860
When the 7th leaf falls,

234
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:01,800
you'll know what a great disaster is.

235
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,390
You're facing a great disaster right now.

236
00:12:05,310 --> 00:12:06,190
Take them away!

237
00:12:06,190 --> 00:12:06,860
Yes, sir!

238
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:09,070
Yingfu! Yingfu,

239
00:12:09,070 --> 00:12:10,740
you mustn't, Yingfu!

240
00:12:11,310 --> 00:12:12,150
Yingfu!

241
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:13,420
Master.

242
00:12:14,370 --> 00:12:15,180
Master.

243
00:12:15,210 --> 00:12:17,790
[Young Zhang Yinhua]

244
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:16,340
I'm sorry.

245
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:17,310
Yingfu!

246
00:12:17,950 --> 00:12:18,910
Yingfu!

247
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:35,960
Hong,

248
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:37,190
what's wrong with you today?

249
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:38,590
Are you not feeling well?

250
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:45,590
Are you still planning to perform
the soul-trapping ritual for the Li family?

251
00:12:45,590 --> 00:12:47,280
That will lead to murder.

252
00:12:51,650 --> 00:12:53,170
When you mentioned

253
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,730
-those 7 falling leaves today...
-I can't...

254
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:58,340
let that slap go unanswered.

255
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:00,510
Can you spare Li Yingfu's life?

256
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:03,590
Okay.

257
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,390
Can you hear me?

258
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:58,780
Blink if you can.

259
00:14:01,210 --> 00:14:03,070
How dare you hit our grandmaster?

260
00:14:12,010 --> 00:14:12,820
Boss,

261
00:14:13,210 --> 00:14:15,030
should we stab him from the mouth down

262
00:14:15,030 --> 00:14:16,460
or from the bottom up?

263
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:17,500
Let's bet on it.

264
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:18,860
The winner drinks for free tonight.

265
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:20,550
Heads or tails?

266
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:20,860
Tails.

267
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:21,460
Heads.

268
00:14:21,460 --> 00:14:22,430
Tails.

269
00:14:22,430 --> 00:14:23,860
Tails.

270
00:14:29,310 --> 00:14:30,100
Flip him over.

271
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:30,950
Alright.

272
00:14:46,950 --> 00:14:47,820
Terrible news!

273
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:48,550
Something happened to Young Master!

274
00:14:48,550 --> 00:14:49,950
Somebody come, quickly!

275
00:15:05,970 --> 00:15:09,650
[Young Li Yingjuan]

276
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:15,620
There are no visible injuries on his body.

277
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:17,770
Take the body back and examine it.

278
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:20,100
This guy was on bad terms with our boss.

279
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:20,950
Did you forget?

280
00:15:20,950 --> 00:15:22,530
Taking him back will just get us scolded.

281
00:15:22,530 --> 00:15:23,770
Officers.

282
00:15:28,730 --> 00:15:30,260
Thank you for your trouble.

283
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:30,900
Let's go!

284
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:31,500
Go.

285
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:37,670
Burn him quickly.

286
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:38,460
Yes, Master.

287
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:39,790
Wait!

288
00:15:40,190 --> 00:15:40,860
Father.

289
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:43,790
He was your own son.

290
00:15:43,950 --> 00:15:45,100
You can't do this.

291
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,100
Enough.

292
00:15:48,150 --> 00:15:49,290
Look.

293
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:51,440
Ever since the day he caused trouble,

294
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,320
the pond in the north has dried up.

295
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:56,350
Crows fly over our yard every day,

296
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:59,040
and our livestock are all listless.

297
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,380
Such a sinful wretch,

298
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:02,140
and you still want him
buried in the ancestral grave?

299
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:04,030
Even if you won't bury him
in the ancestral grave,

300
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:05,550
you must leave his body intact!

301
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:06,070
No.

302
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:07,860
Absolutely not.

303
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:11,190
We must burn this sinful wretch to ashes.

304
00:16:11,390 --> 00:16:12,700
If we keep the body intact,

305
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:14,860
he might come back to harm the family.

306
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:16,430
Take the body away!

307
00:16:16,430 --> 00:16:16,980
Yes!

308
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:25,790
It's okay.

309
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:27,550
I'm here.

310
00:16:37,950 --> 00:16:39,070
You two can go now.

311
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:41,540
Thank you, officers.

312
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:47,560
Taoist Priestess,

313
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:48,860
Master,

314
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:50,820
you two have suffered.

315
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,740
Li Yingfu sent you?

316
00:16:53,030 --> 00:16:55,160
Li Yingfu had no reverence for Heaven,

317
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,030
provoking the wrath of Heaven and men.

318
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:57,700
That...

319
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:03,220
That guy got what he deserved.

320
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:09,410
I came here today
specifically to get you two out,

321
00:17:09,589 --> 00:17:12,869
and I also have a favor to ask.

322
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:14,500
I'm getting married soon.

323
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:16,030
You want us to pray for your marriage?

324
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:17,950
I'm going to
marry the Li family's daughter,

325
00:17:17,950 --> 00:17:19,150
Li Yingjuan.

326
00:17:19,150 --> 00:17:22,550
I've heard that the more deeply
the woman you marry loves you,

327
00:17:22,670 --> 00:17:24,349
the more fortune

328
00:17:24,930 --> 00:17:27,930
her trapped soul brings your family.

329
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:30,490
The soul-trapping ritual
doesn't work on just anyone!

330
00:17:30,490 --> 00:17:32,580
This ritual is very important to me.

331
00:17:32,730 --> 00:17:34,250
I have a friend in Lindi

332
00:17:34,410 --> 00:17:36,810
who has asked me to
arrange canal transport

333
00:17:37,150 --> 00:17:38,460
to smuggle some salt.

334
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:41,060
You know, smuggling salt is...

335
00:17:42,740 --> 00:17:44,590
If I can pull this deal off,

336
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:47,170
I'll be set for life.

337
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:53,030
So you must watch over me

338
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:56,590
and ensure this deal goes
smoothly and safely.

339
00:17:57,780 --> 00:17:58,350
Sir...

340
00:17:58,460 --> 00:17:59,460
Sir,

341
00:17:59,950 --> 00:18:01,910
the soul-trapping ritual costs lives

342
00:18:01,910 --> 00:18:04,220
and will drain my cultivation greatly.

343
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:08,950
Exactly so.

344
00:18:13,430 --> 00:18:15,390
If you two find it too difficult,

345
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:17,630
I shall not impose upon you.

346
00:18:17,950 --> 00:18:18,740
I'll just...

347
00:18:19,670 --> 00:18:21,270
find another Taoist master.

348
00:18:26,740 --> 00:18:27,670
Hong.

349
00:18:29,670 --> 00:18:31,800
I know you don't want me to kill anyone.

350
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:33,350
How about this? I promise you,

351
00:18:33,350 --> 00:18:34,460
I won't get involved in matters

352
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:36,830
concerning the Zhang or Li families again.

353
00:18:36,830 --> 00:18:37,670
Okay?

354
00:18:48,370 --> 00:18:49,200
Sir.

355
00:18:52,570 --> 00:18:53,480
Sir,

356
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:56,070
please give me your Four Pillars of Destiny
and your bride's.

357
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:57,730
Thank you, Taoist Priestess.

358
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:03,010
You're a fraud.

359
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:06,820
I am a fraud.

360
00:19:07,530 --> 00:19:09,500
This soul-trapping ritual is a scam,

361
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:11,350
but not everyone can pull it off.

362
00:19:11,380 --> 00:19:13,540
I saw what Li Yingfu would
go on to accomplish.

363
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:15,190
Anyone who joins
Lord Yuan's New Army these days

364
00:19:15,190 --> 00:19:17,050
is sure to rise through the ranks.

365
00:19:17,210 --> 00:19:19,060
I merely went with the flow.

366
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,880
You clearly said you wouldn't kill him.

367
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:25,500
Li Yingfu believed
we'd scammed his whole family.

368
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,740
He'd already flipped the table.

369
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:27,830
If I hadn't killed him,

370
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:28,670
our bodies would be floating

371
00:19:28,670 --> 00:19:30,150
in the Jialing River by tomorrow morning.

372
00:19:30,150 --> 00:19:31,980
Then we could've just not done the ritual

373
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:32,810
and walked away.

374
00:19:32,810 --> 00:19:35,390
This is the scam handed to us personally
by the old Sect Master.

375
00:19:35,390 --> 00:19:37,510
Back then, when he ran a scam
on the Elder Brothers Society,

376
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:38,500
he personally threw

377
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:41,790
his nephew into the furnace
to keep the scam from being exposed.

378
00:19:41,790 --> 00:19:43,070
He set the rule—

379
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:44,780
whoever ruins the sect's business

380
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:46,510
must take the fall for the sect.

381
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:50,740
Right now, we're choosing
a new Sect Master.

382
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:53,200
The other Batous are all watching.

383
00:19:53,300 --> 00:19:54,690
If I mess up this scam,

384
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:56,670
I'll never be able to turn things around.

385
00:19:56,670 --> 00:19:58,220
When another Batou
becomes the Sect Master,

386
00:19:58,220 --> 00:19:59,670
they'll definitely kill me.

387
00:19:59,670 --> 00:20:01,200
And once I die, you're next.

388
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:07,220
I'm a fraud.

389
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:08,790
You're right not to trust me.

390
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,830
But don't forget

391
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,910
why Zhang Yinhua came to you.

392
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:17,620
You're the one
who brought out the darkness in him,

393
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:20,300
and that's why he wants
a soul-trapping ritual.

394
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:22,460
You think a few words could tempt him?

395
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:24,910
Li Yingfu's success made him jealous.

396
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:27,480
Even if you don't do it,
someone else will.

397
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,780
I'm very good at reading people.

398
00:20:31,020 --> 00:20:32,460
Zhang Yinhua is a ruthless man.

399
00:20:32,460 --> 00:20:33,700
Now his canal transport business

400
00:20:33,700 --> 00:20:36,020
has everything going for it.

401
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,590
All he wants is some reassurance.

402
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:40,390
By then, if he finds someone at random
to perform the ritual

403
00:20:40,390 --> 00:20:41,790
and then makes a fortune,

404
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:42,740
he'll come to believe in it completely

405
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:44,400
and keep having it performed.

406
00:20:49,950 --> 00:20:50,750
Seal the soul.

407
00:21:46,340 --> 00:21:49,100
[Li Yingjuan]

408
00:21:56,530 --> 00:21:57,440
Come out first.

409
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:02,830
It's alright now.

410
00:22:04,220 --> 00:22:05,300
It's alright now.

411
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:08,120
Let me take the nail out of your head.

412
00:22:16,180 --> 00:22:17,150
It's okay now.

413
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:19,670
Let's go.

414
00:22:33,190 --> 00:22:34,590
Don't be afraid. It's me.

415
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:36,740
I brought you some food.

416
00:22:36,740 --> 00:22:38,180
There are some dry clothes inside.

417
00:22:38,180 --> 00:22:39,840
Come on, let's leave quickly.

418
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:42,720
Search everywhere!

419
00:22:42,870 --> 00:22:43,590
This way.

420
00:22:44,950 --> 00:22:46,280
-This way!
-Be careful.

421
00:22:47,220 --> 00:22:47,910
Hurry!

422
00:22:48,780 --> 00:22:49,980
Don't let her escape!

423
00:22:51,190 --> 00:22:52,060
Find her!

424
00:22:53,220 --> 00:22:54,350
Search everywhere!

425
00:22:58,380 --> 00:23:00,130
Is my family here looking for me?

426
00:23:00,130 --> 00:23:01,540
Those are people from the Tianxiang Sect.

427
00:23:01,540 --> 00:23:02,500
You go quickly.

428
00:23:02,530 --> 00:23:03,400
This way!

429
00:23:04,020 --> 00:23:04,590
Go.

430
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:05,630
What about you?

431
00:23:06,580 --> 00:23:07,930
I'll go stall them.

432
00:23:08,830 --> 00:23:10,350
Otherwise, neither of us

433
00:23:10,980 --> 00:23:12,640
will make it through tonight.

434
00:23:13,060 --> 00:23:13,910
Go.

435
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:15,540
Go!

436
00:23:48,180 --> 00:23:49,140
Grandmaster.

437
00:23:50,020 --> 00:23:50,670
Take her away.

438
00:23:50,670 --> 00:23:51,390
-Yes.
-Yes.

439
00:23:58,430 --> 00:23:59,500
Grandmaster.

440
00:23:59,780 --> 00:24:00,840
Where is Shangguan Hong?

441
00:24:00,840 --> 00:24:03,150
We couldn't stop her.
She went down the mountain.

442
00:24:03,150 --> 00:24:04,280
Should we chase her?

443
00:24:05,870 --> 00:24:06,870
Back to the sect.

444
00:24:07,220 --> 00:24:07,910
Yes.

445
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:17,080
She knows you and Shangguan Hong
are in this together.

446
00:24:17,370 --> 00:24:21,050
If she tells people
how Li Yingfu really died,

447
00:24:21,340 --> 00:24:23,780
then our scam will be

448
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:25,910
completely blown.

449
00:24:26,230 --> 00:24:29,840
Shangguan Hong has betrayed
our Tianxiang Sect.

450
00:24:30,430 --> 00:24:31,460
Her life...

451
00:24:32,540 --> 00:24:34,060
no longer belongs to her.

452
00:24:34,220 --> 00:24:36,280
I've issued an order to hunt her down.

453
00:24:36,460 --> 00:24:37,740
We should keep

454
00:24:38,020 --> 00:24:39,590
our troubles

455
00:24:39,850 --> 00:24:41,370
behind closed doors.

456
00:24:43,430 --> 00:24:46,910
I know
you and Shangguan Hong are quite close.

457
00:24:47,050 --> 00:24:49,050
So I'm saving your face.

458
00:24:49,260 --> 00:24:53,220
But you can't make me lose mine.

459
00:24:54,460 --> 00:24:55,220
Master,

460
00:24:56,220 --> 00:24:57,540
Li Yingjuan can't die.

461
00:24:57,740 --> 00:24:58,770
As long as she lives,

462
00:24:58,770 --> 00:25:00,420
your reputation remains intact.

463
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:02,430
Li Yingfu's body has already been burned.

464
00:25:02,430 --> 00:25:04,840
Even if the government want to
investigate, they won't find anything.

465
00:25:04,840 --> 00:25:06,370
And you taught me yourself:

466
00:25:06,390 --> 00:25:09,150
fear is the best way to make money.

467
00:25:10,120 --> 00:25:11,600
I want to take her back,

468
00:25:11,830 --> 00:25:13,150
so whenever people see this madwoman,

469
00:25:13,150 --> 00:25:14,460
they'll think of you.

470
00:25:14,830 --> 00:25:16,110
And they'll all

471
00:25:16,660 --> 00:25:17,740
revere you

472
00:25:18,150 --> 00:25:19,260
like a god.

473
00:25:39,220 --> 00:25:40,020
You're awake.

474
00:25:41,020 --> 00:25:42,620
The drug hasn't worn off yet.

475
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,580
You'll be fine in a couple of days.

476
00:25:47,430 --> 00:25:48,960
Where... are you taking me?

477
00:25:49,430 --> 00:25:50,320
Home.

478
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:03,740
[Li Residence]

479
00:26:18,910 --> 00:26:20,970
Give her this bowl of talisman water.

480
00:26:20,980 --> 00:26:21,870
Okay, okay.

481
00:26:25,260 --> 00:26:27,260
The Zhang family has trapped her soul.

482
00:26:27,260 --> 00:26:29,050
I performed rituals for 3 straight days

483
00:26:29,050 --> 00:26:31,310
and only managed to
bring back her 1 soul and 1 spirit.

484
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,420
The Zhangs...

485
00:26:32,500 --> 00:26:34,780
I'll fight them to the death!

486
00:26:35,740 --> 00:26:37,220
I've done a reading for you.

487
00:26:37,220 --> 00:26:39,510
If you clash with the Zhangs again,

488
00:26:40,100 --> 00:26:42,140
your family will face utter ruin.

489
00:26:43,020 --> 00:26:45,740
After all, the Zhangs
have the Salt Gang behind them.

490
00:26:45,740 --> 00:26:46,780
I advise you

491
00:26:46,780 --> 00:26:48,110
to let go of this grudge.

492
00:26:48,430 --> 00:26:49,350
Over the next few days,

493
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:51,060
I'll continue to perform rituals
for Li Yingjuan,

494
00:26:51,060 --> 00:26:53,460
and her souls and spirits
will naturally return.

495
00:26:53,460 --> 00:26:55,780
But from now on, you must hide her well

496
00:26:56,300 --> 00:26:58,830
and not let the Zhangs
know she's still alive.

497
00:27:02,700 --> 00:27:03,390
Okay.

498
00:27:04,350 --> 00:27:05,020
Okay.

499
00:27:06,390 --> 00:27:07,740
Thank you, Master.

500
00:27:09,390 --> 00:27:10,150
Go.

501
00:27:10,260 --> 00:27:11,210
Leave.

502
00:27:21,220 --> 00:27:22,700
If I'd acted as I normally would,

503
00:27:22,700 --> 00:27:24,590
you would've been dead long ago.

504
00:27:26,540 --> 00:27:27,910
But for Shangguan Hong's sake,

505
00:27:27,910 --> 00:27:29,060
I'll spare you.

506
00:27:29,300 --> 00:27:31,500
Now cooperate with me to finish the act.

507
00:27:37,230 --> 00:27:38,460
At that time, I thought

508
00:27:38,460 --> 00:27:40,460
the matter of the soul-trapping ritual
had ended there.

509
00:27:40,460 --> 00:27:41,950
Who would have thought that,
only some years later,

510
00:27:41,950 --> 00:27:44,780
Zhang Yinhua would want another
soul-trapping ritual?

511
00:27:44,780 --> 00:27:48,180
And the helper he found
turned out to be the Sect Master again.

512
00:27:48,220 --> 00:27:51,330
Zhang Yinhua's coughing up blood must also
have been arranged by the Sect Master.

513
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:53,960
I even suspect that Li Ling's marriage,

514
00:27:54,460 --> 00:27:56,860
and what you told me
about him and my mother,

515
00:27:57,500 --> 00:27:59,360
are all part of his calculations.

516
00:28:00,870 --> 00:28:02,800
But I still have to thank you, Aunt,

517
00:28:03,220 --> 00:28:04,950
for letting me pick up on something.

518
00:28:04,950 --> 00:28:05,590
Wait.

519
00:28:06,020 --> 00:28:08,220
Why didn't I pick up anything from that?

520
00:28:08,300 --> 00:28:11,170
I just think
that the Sect Master is a good person.

521
00:28:11,350 --> 00:28:12,910
He didn't want to kill anyone either.

522
00:28:12,910 --> 00:28:14,500
He was forced into it.

523
00:28:14,500 --> 00:28:15,300
That's right.

524
00:28:15,850 --> 00:28:18,110
That's exactly what he wanted to tell me.

525
00:28:18,910 --> 00:28:20,300
Now you've stopped
believing in him, haven't you?

526
00:28:20,300 --> 00:28:21,220
His son

527
00:28:21,220 --> 00:28:23,390
must know what his father is up to.

528
00:28:28,390 --> 00:28:30,720
A car has been following us
the whole time.

529
00:28:33,780 --> 00:28:35,780
It looks like the Sixth Batou's car.

530
00:28:35,910 --> 00:28:37,260
Then why don't we...

531
00:28:39,110 --> 00:28:40,310
play along
and beat them at their own game?

532
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:43,750
[Zhang Residence]

533
00:28:52,370 --> 00:28:53,340
Sleepy?

534
00:28:53,910 --> 00:28:56,330
Our Salt Gang is short of everything
but salt.

535
00:28:56,330 --> 00:28:57,050
Go.

536
00:28:57,450 --> 00:28:58,820
Wake him up.

537
00:29:25,910 --> 00:29:27,020
Awake now?

538
00:29:27,630 --> 00:29:28,260
Tell us!

539
00:29:28,390 --> 00:29:30,670
Where did you take the woman from the vat?

540
00:29:33,700 --> 00:29:34,500
I

541
00:29:35,390 --> 00:29:37,220
have told you many times.

542
00:29:37,460 --> 00:29:38,950
I've cooperated with
the Zhang family for years

543
00:29:38,950 --> 00:29:40,700
and never made a mistake.

544
00:29:40,900 --> 00:29:44,110
This time, some expert must've
come after the Zhang family.

545
00:29:44,110 --> 00:29:47,390
Master Zhang wants us to
get to the bottom of this today.

546
00:29:48,460 --> 00:29:50,780
Priestess, I don't want to
lay a hand on you.

547
00:29:50,780 --> 00:29:51,830
But if you don't

548
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,780
give me an answer by the end of today,

549
00:29:53,780 --> 00:29:55,500
I'll have to give you both a taste

550
00:29:55,500 --> 00:29:57,110
of what we can do!

551
00:29:59,110 --> 00:30:00,390
In the soul-trapping ritual,

552
00:30:00,390 --> 00:30:02,220
we first have to
break down the physical body,

553
00:30:02,220 --> 00:30:04,070
then gather the 3 souls and 6 spirits.

554
00:30:04,070 --> 00:30:05,130
Now look what happened.

555
00:30:05,130 --> 00:30:06,740
We'd only just finished the first step

556
00:30:06,740 --> 00:30:07,900
and hadn't gathered the souls yet.

557
00:30:07,900 --> 00:30:09,700
And Master Zhang opened the vat!

558
00:30:09,700 --> 00:30:11,580
How could Li Ling's soul not scatter?

559
00:30:11,580 --> 00:30:12,880
You can't blame us for this.

560
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:15,260
Even if you beat him to death today,
it won't help.

561
00:30:15,260 --> 00:30:16,110
Understand?

562
00:30:17,300 --> 00:30:18,230
What did she say?

563
00:30:18,730 --> 00:30:19,930
Did you understand?

564
00:30:24,060 --> 00:30:26,390
I know.

565
00:30:26,510 --> 00:30:28,560
It's just like mining salt.

566
00:30:28,740 --> 00:30:30,590
First, remove impurities from the brine,

567
00:30:30,590 --> 00:30:31,980
then boil it down into salt.

568
00:30:31,980 --> 00:30:34,190
Just like breaking it apart
and regrouping it.

569
00:30:34,190 --> 00:30:36,500
Boiling salt and soul-trapping
are the same thing.

570
00:30:36,500 --> 00:30:38,190
That makes sense.

571
00:30:38,350 --> 00:30:40,460
Come with me to see Master Zhang.

572
00:30:40,460 --> 00:30:41,630
I'm afraid I can't explain it clearly.

573
00:30:41,630 --> 00:30:42,980
Alright, alright!

574
00:30:51,740 --> 00:30:53,000
You did it, didn't you?

575
00:30:53,780 --> 00:30:55,780
And that brat Shangguan Chengming.

576
00:30:57,460 --> 00:31:00,390
I knew it. When you're with him,

577
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:02,630
you must be up to no good.

578
00:31:04,780 --> 00:31:05,700
This...

579
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:08,050
has nothing to do with him.

580
00:31:09,020 --> 00:31:09,780
Yanzi,

581
00:31:10,670 --> 00:31:12,150
are you taking me for a fool?

582
00:31:12,150 --> 00:31:13,870
How could he have nothing to do with this?

583
00:31:13,870 --> 00:31:15,670
I must've owed you in a past life.

584
00:31:22,910 --> 00:31:24,310
I just don't understand.

585
00:31:25,020 --> 00:31:26,190
All these years,

586
00:31:26,780 --> 00:31:30,190
we've been through thick and thin together,
escorting goods and running scams.

587
00:31:30,190 --> 00:31:32,450
I've taken the fall for you so many times,

588
00:31:32,780 --> 00:31:34,640
and I've never once regretted it.

589
00:31:35,500 --> 00:31:36,060
But...

590
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:39,490
what has Shangguan Chengming ever done
for you?

591
00:32:08,270 --> 00:32:08,900
Master,

592
00:32:09,230 --> 00:32:11,550
the Zhang residence
is just around the bend.

593
00:32:11,550 --> 00:32:13,110
Looks like he has no choice.

594
00:32:13,150 --> 00:32:13,910
In the end,

595
00:32:13,910 --> 00:32:17,110
he still has to kill Li Ling
for the soul-trapping ritual.

596
00:32:53,460 --> 00:32:54,190
What...

597
00:32:54,820 --> 00:32:56,080
What's wrong with her?

598
00:32:56,390 --> 00:32:57,740
You know her?

599
00:32:58,020 --> 00:33:00,780
Then I came to the right place.

600
00:33:01,110 --> 00:33:03,220
Last night, I was wandering along
the road to the underworld

601
00:33:03,220 --> 00:33:05,100
and having a pleasant chat with Meng Po.

602
00:33:05,100 --> 00:33:08,420
Suddenly, I saw a girl
standing on the Bridge of Oblivion.

603
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:11,060
She just stood there, dazed,
and wouldn't cross.

604
00:33:11,060 --> 00:33:12,220
So I asked her,

605
00:33:12,430 --> 00:33:13,950
"Are you lost?"

606
00:33:14,020 --> 00:33:15,980
She said she couldn't leave

607
00:33:16,150 --> 00:33:18,020
because her soul was trapped.

608
00:33:18,020 --> 00:33:20,670
Then I asked her who had trapped her soul.

609
00:33:21,020 --> 00:33:22,500
She then led me

610
00:33:22,980 --> 00:33:24,910
to your residence.

611
00:33:26,910 --> 00:33:30,430
Then is she a living person or a ghost?

612
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:32,870
The living and the dead
belong to different realms.

613
00:33:32,870 --> 00:33:34,780
She is caught somewhere in between—

614
00:33:34,780 --> 00:33:36,180
neither human nor ghost,

615
00:33:36,430 --> 00:33:37,780
both alive and dead.

616
00:33:38,180 --> 00:33:41,420
May I ask, sir, who you really are?

617
00:33:41,750 --> 00:33:43,990
I have walked through
the Celestial Masters' Hall

618
00:33:43,990 --> 00:33:46,060
and torn pages from
the Book of Life and Death.

619
00:33:46,060 --> 00:33:48,460
Now I conceal my deeds and fame

620
00:33:48,930 --> 00:33:52,620
and live as a carefree hermit
in the mountains.

621
00:34:15,750 --> 00:34:17,010
Forgive my frankness,

622
00:34:17,500 --> 00:34:18,460
old sir,

623
00:34:19,020 --> 00:34:21,480
but there seem to be
quite a few lost girls...

624
00:34:22,980 --> 00:34:24,350
at your residence.

625
00:34:26,860 --> 00:34:28,050
Where

626
00:34:28,580 --> 00:34:29,949
are they?

627
00:34:30,050 --> 00:34:32,380
Aren't they right here in your courtyard,

628
00:34:33,250 --> 00:34:34,600
following you?

629
00:34:43,949 --> 00:34:44,949
Master,

630
00:34:46,020 --> 00:34:49,460
please don't joke with an old man like me.

631
00:34:50,489 --> 00:34:52,530
Since I've delivered her,

632
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:54,600
I should take my leave.

633
00:34:54,870 --> 00:34:56,750
But let me remind you:

634
00:34:57,139 --> 00:34:58,430
she is now neither human nor ghost,

635
00:34:58,430 --> 00:34:59,890
a creature of extreme Yin.

636
00:35:00,810 --> 00:35:02,440
Whoever touches her dies.

637
00:35:05,710 --> 00:35:06,390
Let's go.

638
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:08,790
Master,

639
00:35:09,060 --> 00:35:10,140
please wait.

640
00:35:12,660 --> 00:35:14,540
I'm old,

641
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:18,020
and I'd like your help finding a way

642
00:35:18,270 --> 00:35:21,660
to lay this girl's wandering soul to rest.

643
00:35:22,310 --> 00:35:24,750
Whoever started the trouble should end it.

644
00:35:24,980 --> 00:35:26,460
You have to tell me honestly

645
00:35:26,460 --> 00:35:27,870
how she died,

646
00:35:28,140 --> 00:35:30,100
and only then can I help you find

647
00:35:30,790 --> 00:35:32,310
a way to resolve it.

648
00:35:34,710 --> 00:35:37,350
She died suddenly

649
00:35:38,180 --> 00:35:39,310
on the wedding night.

650
00:35:39,310 --> 00:35:40,710
A young maiden,

651
00:35:40,710 --> 00:35:42,710
with no illness or health problems,

652
00:35:42,950 --> 00:35:44,140
just dropped dead?

653
00:35:44,500 --> 00:35:46,160
That is indeed what happened.

654
00:35:46,660 --> 00:35:48,710
Her death is so mysterious,

655
00:35:48,710 --> 00:35:51,430
and her resentment
won't fade anytime soon.

656
00:35:51,580 --> 00:35:53,230
I have to take her away,

657
00:35:53,350 --> 00:35:56,100
lock her up at my master's retreat
deep in the mountains,

658
00:35:56,100 --> 00:35:58,270
and seal her with a soul-suppressing rite.

659
00:35:58,270 --> 00:36:01,310
That way, Li Ling's soul
can pass into its next life?

660
00:36:01,340 --> 00:36:02,340
Not necessarily.

661
00:36:02,350 --> 00:36:04,860
This ritual will take at least a week.

662
00:36:04,890 --> 00:36:05,830
During that time,

663
00:36:05,830 --> 00:36:07,970
she can leave her physical body
and roam freely.

664
00:36:07,970 --> 00:36:10,350
You and your family
must be extremely careful,

665
00:36:10,350 --> 00:36:11,810
lest she possess one of you

666
00:36:12,230 --> 00:36:13,760
and bring ruin upon you all.

667
00:36:14,220 --> 00:36:16,550
The eyes are both
the entrance and the exit.

668
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:19,680
Everyone in your household
who has seen Miss Li Ling

669
00:36:19,860 --> 00:36:21,830
must drink water with these talismans

670
00:36:21,830 --> 00:36:23,980
to stay safe.

671
00:36:24,860 --> 00:36:25,860
Old sir,

672
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:26,950
always let

673
00:36:27,100 --> 00:36:28,500
compassion guide you.

674
00:36:28,790 --> 00:36:29,870
I can sense

675
00:36:29,870 --> 00:36:32,790
that there are cultivators
staying in your residence.

676
00:36:32,790 --> 00:36:34,870
I hope you treat them well,

677
00:36:34,870 --> 00:36:37,140
lest you damage your own karmic virtue

678
00:36:38,210 --> 00:36:40,610
and give the wandering souls following you

679
00:36:41,060 --> 00:36:42,710
an opening.

680
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:52,790
Wait,

681
00:36:53,050 --> 00:36:54,780
why have they brought her out?

682
00:36:55,180 --> 00:36:56,750
Keep a close eye on them.

683
00:36:58,230 --> 00:36:59,350
G-Got it, Master.

684
00:37:05,910 --> 00:37:06,640
Master.

685
00:37:08,810 --> 00:37:09,870
Shangguan Chengming

686
00:37:09,870 --> 00:37:12,020
took Li Ling to the Zhang residence

687
00:37:13,620 --> 00:37:15,280
but then brought her back out.

688
00:37:16,430 --> 00:37:17,540
Interesting.

689
00:37:19,620 --> 00:37:22,080
When do you think
the fish will take the bait?

690
00:37:37,450 --> 00:37:38,910
Master Zhang has ordered:

691
00:37:39,230 --> 00:37:40,750
finish the talisman water,

692
00:37:40,750 --> 00:37:42,230
not a drop left!

693
00:38:06,660 --> 00:38:07,350
Let's go.

694
00:38:09,090 --> 00:38:10,970
Aunt, wait for us in the car.

695
00:38:13,100 --> 00:38:14,070
Be careful.

696
00:38:28,270 --> 00:38:30,020
Looks like they've all drunk
the talisman water.

697
00:38:30,020 --> 00:38:31,950
You guys go move Zhang Yuanfan out.

698
00:38:32,270 --> 00:38:33,140
I'll go find Jiang Feiyan.

699
00:38:33,140 --> 00:38:33,870
Okay.

700
00:38:34,500 --> 00:38:35,230
Let's go.

701
00:38:51,250 --> 00:38:53,520
He won't wake up suddenly, will he?

702
00:38:53,660 --> 00:38:54,660
Watch.

703
00:38:56,980 --> 00:38:57,940
He won't wake up.

704
00:38:59,100 --> 00:39:00,540
This brat clearly knows about
the soul-trapping ritual.

705
00:39:00,540 --> 00:39:01,670
He just wanted to harm you.

706
00:39:01,670 --> 00:39:04,470
Why don't you hit him a few times
to vent your anger?

707
00:39:06,490 --> 00:39:07,130
Come on.

708
00:39:09,860 --> 00:39:11,060
Enough, enough.

709
00:39:17,530 --> 00:39:18,260
No...

710
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:19,480
Don't do it like that.

711
00:39:20,100 --> 00:39:21,420
What are you doing?

712
00:39:21,450 --> 00:39:22,910
Didn't you say he wouldn't wake up?

713
00:39:22,910 --> 00:39:25,510
This would be way too painful.
You'll wake him.

714
00:39:53,010 --> 00:39:55,180
Second Master, what are you doing?

715
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,280
I know that brat is here.

716
00:39:57,410 --> 00:39:58,700
The moment he shows up,

717
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,070
I'll kill him.

718
00:40:03,100 --> 00:40:03,960
Second Master.

719
00:40:04,270 --> 00:40:05,870
As long as that kid is around,

720
00:40:06,430 --> 00:40:08,490
he'll get you killed sooner or later.

721
00:40:08,950 --> 00:40:09,810
Second Master.

722
00:40:10,020 --> 00:40:10,910
Second Master!

723
00:40:19,900 --> 00:40:20,710
Feiyan.

724
00:40:23,780 --> 00:40:24,450
Watch out!

725
00:40:27,660 --> 00:40:28,500
Second Master,

726
00:40:28,500 --> 00:40:29,620
look closely, it's me!

727
00:40:29,620 --> 00:40:31,020
You little brat,

728
00:40:31,270 --> 00:40:32,380
you screw me over every single time.

729
00:40:32,380 --> 00:40:34,340
You're exactly the one I want to chop!

730
00:40:34,340 --> 00:40:36,470
Second Master, put the knife down now!

731
00:40:39,100 --> 00:40:40,290
If you really kill him,

732
00:40:40,290 --> 00:40:41,430
how will you explain it
to the Sect Master?

733
00:40:41,430 --> 00:40:42,510
It's fine!

734
00:40:42,540 --> 00:40:43,620
I'll kill him

735
00:40:43,620 --> 00:40:45,790
and then let the Sect Master kill me.

736
00:40:47,060 --> 00:40:47,920
Second Master,

737
00:40:48,200 --> 00:40:49,390
think carefully.

738
00:40:49,460 --> 00:40:51,270
Who benefits most
if this scam falls apart?

739
00:40:51,270 --> 00:40:53,140
Second Master, neither of us
wants to ruin this scam.

740
00:40:53,140 --> 00:40:54,660
If no one had found out about the vat,

741
00:40:54,660 --> 00:40:55,580
you'd have made the money,

742
00:40:55,580 --> 00:40:56,540
I'd have saved that girl and left,

743
00:40:56,540 --> 00:40:57,790
and we'd have
stayed out of each other's way.

744
00:40:57,790 --> 00:40:58,390
Think about it.

745
00:40:58,390 --> 00:41:00,140
Why is it that
right after we took Li Ling away,

746
00:41:00,140 --> 00:41:02,200
Zhang Yinhua discovered our secret?

747
00:41:02,740 --> 00:41:05,340
It's obvious someone is trying to
set you up.

748
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:06,220
Second Master,

749
00:41:06,730 --> 00:41:08,460
you're being used as someone's pawn!

750
00:41:08,460 --> 00:41:10,350
Someone has been watching us
in this scam the whole time,

751
00:41:10,350 --> 00:41:12,070
afraid that you might
pull it off perfectly.

752
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:13,540
The closer you get to the Sect Master,

753
00:41:13,540 --> 00:41:15,800
whose position do you threaten the most?

754
00:41:25,050 --> 00:41:25,750
Sixth Master,

755
00:41:25,750 --> 00:41:27,280
looks like it's about time.

756
00:41:39,820 --> 00:41:40,820
Sixth Master,

757
00:41:42,220 --> 00:41:44,550
you've been watching the show at the door.

758
00:41:47,450 --> 00:41:48,620
You must be tired.

759
00:41:51,130 --> 00:41:53,310
[In the next episode]

760
00:41:53,350 --> 00:41:54,270
You're here.

761
00:41:54,270 --> 00:41:54,830
Master,

762
00:41:54,860 --> 00:41:55,700
I was wrong.

763
00:41:56,020 --> 00:41:57,170
I shouldn't have saved Li Ling.

764
00:41:57,170 --> 00:42:00,030
Looks like she wasn't the only one
you saved, right?

765
00:42:02,540 --> 00:42:04,460
Shatter their souls,

766
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:06,320
and you can return to
the world of the living.

767
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:07,550
I'm your stepmom,

768
00:42:07,570 --> 00:42:08,860
Xijiao.

769
00:42:09,660 --> 00:42:11,270
All of you, die!

770
00:42:11,540 --> 00:42:12,620
No!

771
00:42:15,980 --> 00:42:18,150
Didn't we agree not to kill?

772
00:42:18,320 --> 00:42:19,800
To make money,

773
00:42:20,790 --> 00:42:22,020
blood must be shed.
